Subject: [PATCH i2c-next v3 2/3] i2c: aspeed: Add 'aspeed,timeout' DT property reading code
Date:   Wed, 26 Sep 2018 14:58:41 -0700
Message-Id: <20180926215842.23125-3-jae.hyun.yoo@linux.intel.com>
